WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 27 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.200
That wretched old hag.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.700
How dare she steal my spotlight?

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.700
You're forgetting something.

4
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.200
Tradition says we princesses have to share the first dance with our dates.

5
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.700
You've got the best court dance skills here.

6
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.700
And she?

7
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.700
Exactly.

8
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.700
She hasn't attended a ball since the curse.

9
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.200
I bet she's forgotten even the most basic steps.

10
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:29.670
You've probably forgotten how the opening dance even works, haven't you, my dear sister?

11
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.670
And your three filthy beasts.

12
00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.670
What do they even know about noble court dances?

13
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:37.670
Cassie's right. A beast is a beast.

14
00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.670
Slapping a suit on them doesn't make them gentlemen.

15
00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:45.170
Sylvia, if you beg for my forgiveness now,

16
00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.170
I might kindly allow you to finish this dance with me.

17
00:00:49.170 --> 00:01:42.650
No matter what it takes, I swear I will win Sylvia back.

18
00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:46.150
And make her willingly kneel at my feet.
